message: "Cite the exact repository commit and the specific experiment protocol/result files. This rolling research preview is not a peer-reviewed paper."
title: "Canaria Neural Simplification"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Unjuno"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Unjuno/canaria-neural-simplification"
