abstract: >-
  Research code and auditable evidence for task-conditioned compositional
  simplification of learned neural computations. The baseline, separately indexed
  experiments, negative results, and invalidated history have explicit scopes.
  No universal compression or general hardware-resource advantage is claimed.
keywords:
  - neural-network simplification
  - compositional simplification
  - functional replacement
  - reproducible research
